1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,800
Bilbo!

2
00:00:01,420 --> 00:00:02,380
Bilbo!

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,220
My precious.

4
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:18,410
This is the One Ring, forged by
the Dark Lord Sauron in the fires

5
00:00:18,460 --> 00:00:23,380
of Mount Doom, taken by Isildur
from the hand of Sauron himself.

6
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:26,240
Bilbo found it.

7
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:33,470
In Gollum's cave. Yes. For sixty
years the Ring lay quiet in Bilbo's

8
00:00:33,520 --> 00:00:37,620
keepin', prolonging his
life, delaying old age.

9
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:43,050
But no longer, Frodo.
Evil is stirring in Mordor.

10
00:00:43,100 --> 00:00:45,000
The Ring has awoken.

11
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:48,520
It's heard its master's call.

12
00:00:48,720 --> 00:00:50,220
But he was destroyed.

13
00:00:51,120 --> 00:00:52,720
Sauron was destroyed.

14
00:01:01,180 --> 00:01:04,280
The spirit of Sauron endured.

15
00:01:05,680 --> 00:01:08,660
Frodo, you must never find it.

16
00:01:10,620 --> 00:01:12,260
What must I do?
